popareaSquareMiles2023 = areaSquareMiles,
popgrowthRate2022to2023 = growthRate2022to2023, #pop_2024 is population as of Jan 2023, pop_2023 is same for Jan 2022, so the name of the variable is changed here to reflect actual dates of population not what WPR names the years
popgrowthRateSince2010 = popgrowthSince2010,
pop_highschool2021 = PercentHighSchoolOrHigher2024, #variables recorded in 2024 but from ACS 2021 5-yr survey
